# Sanity Setup (5 Rules)

## 59. Shared Schema Objects
Reuse: seo.ts, imageWithAlt.ts, portableText.ts, cta.ts across document types.

## 60. Publish Validation
Block publish if missing: Title, Slug, Required alt text. Use studio/lib/validation.ts.

## 61. Centralized Queries
ALL GROQ queries in ONE file: src/lib/content/sanity.ts. One file to maintain.

## 62. Slug Change Handling
When slug changes: Auto 301 redirect OR flag for manual review. Never break URLs.

## 63. Separate Datasets
production = Live content, staging = Testing. NEVER test on production.
